                <pb facs="0568" n="460" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg460"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/5011: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-02-07T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 7,
                                1927—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>50. Your 114, February 5, 9 p.m. I do not desire you to participate in
                    representations of the kind described in paragraph 3 of your telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
